  "referenceNumber": "RUS1990",
  "remarks": "\nLIMITED LIABILITY COMPANY TECHNOLOGICAL COMPANY FLY BRIDGE (FLY BRIDGE) is an involved person within the meaning of the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 in that FLY BRIDGE is an electronics importer.  FLY BRIDGE is therefore involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by operating in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the Russian electronics sector. \n",
